<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>Si-eun's iPhone</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; user-select: none; }
        body { background: #111; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; color: #fff; padding: 10px; }
        
        .phone {
            width: 375px; height: 780px; background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;
            border-radius: 48px; border: 12px solid #2d2d2d; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        .status-bar { height: 44px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 0 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; z-index: 10; }
        .notch { width: 110px; height: 30px; background: #000; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); border-bottom-left-radius: 18px; border-bottom-right-radius: 18px; z-index: 20; }

        .widget-area { padding: 10px 20px; }
        .time-widget { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); padding: 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #ddd; }
        .time-widget .date { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }

        .app-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 18px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .app-icon { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
        .app-icon div { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-size: 28px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .app-icon span { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 6px; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }

        .dock { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); margin: 15px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 28px; display: flex; justify-content: space-around; }

        /* Modal App Screens */
        .app-screen { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: #000; z-index: 100; display: none; flex-direction: column; animation: slideUp 0.25s ease-out; }
        @keyframes slideUp { from { transform: translateY(100%); } to { transform: translateY(0); } }

        .screen-header { height: 70px; padding-top: 25px; background: #1c1c1e; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }
        .back-btn { color: #0a84ff; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; }
        .screen-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 15px; color: #fff; }

        /* Custom App Styles */
        .list-item { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2c2e; font-size: 14px; }
        .call-screen { background: #000; text-align: center; padding-top: 100px; }
        .call-btn-red { width: 65px; height: 65px; background: #ff3b30; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin: 40px auto 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 24px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="phone">
    <div class="notch"></div>
    <div class="status-bar">
        <span>20:59</span>
        <span>5G 📶 50%</span>
    </div>

    <div class="widget-area">
        <div class="time-widget">
            <div style="color:#aaa;">수요일</div>
            <div class="date">10월 21일</div>
            <div>📍 서울, 대한민국 (-2°)</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('safari')">
            <div style="background: #2ba8f6;">🧭</div>
            <span>Safari</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('photos')">
            <div style="background: #fff;">🖼️</div>
            <span>사진</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('instagram')">
            <div style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433, #bc1888);">📸</div>
            <span>인스타그램</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('music')">
            <div style="background: #fa2d48;">🎵</div>
            <span>음악</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('notes')">
            <div style="background: #f1c40f;">📝</div>
            <span>메모</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('messages')">
            <div style="background: #34c759;">💬</div>
            <span>메시지</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openCall('수호')">
            <div style="background: #30d158;">📞</div>
            <span>전화</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dock">
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openCall('수호')"><div style="background: #30d158; width:50px; height:50px;">📞</div></div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('safari')"><div style="background: #2ba8f6; width:50px; height:50px;">🧭</div></div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('messages')"><div style="background: #34c759; width:50px; height:50px;">💬</div></div>
        <div class="app-icon" onclick="openApp('music')"><div style="background: #fa2d48; width:50px; height:50px;">🎵</div></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Safari Screen -->
    <div id="safari" class="app-screen">
        <div class="screen-header"><span class="back-btn" onclick="closeApp('safari')">‹ 완료</span><b>Safari 검색 기록</b><span></span></div>
        <div class="screen-content">
            <div class="list-item">🔍 우울증 증상 및 극복 방법</div>
            <div class="list-item">🔍 수면제 부작용 및 처방 병원</div>
            <div class="list-item">🔍 은장고등학교 위치 및 정보</div>
            <div class="list-item">🔍 소중한 사람에게 남기는 편지</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Notes Screen -->
    <div id="notes" class="app-screen">
        <div class="screen-header"><span class="back-btn" onclick="closeApp('notes')">‹ 메모</span><b>작별 편지</b><span></span></div>
        <div class="screen-content" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #ddd;">
            <p>안녕. 이 편지를 볼 때쯤엔 모든 게 끝났을지도 모르겠네.</p>
            <p>네가 없는 하루가 이렇게 길 줄 몰랐어. 그때 내가 조금만 더 솔직했더라면 달라졌을까?</p>
            <p>보고 싶다는 말조차 이제는 할 수 없네. 딱 한 번만이라도 네 목소리를 듣고 싶어...</p>
            <br><hr style="border-color:#333;"><br>
            <b style="color:#fff;">[시험 일정 & 학원 메모]</b>
            <p>• 11월 수능 모의고사 준비</p>
            <p>• 수학/수학2 학원 보강 (월/수/금)</p>
            <p>• 수호 병원 방문 일정 체크</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Call Screen -->
    <div id="callScreen" class="app-screen call-screen">
        <h2 id="callName" style="font-size: 28px;">수호</h2>
        <p id="callStatus" style="color: #aaa; margin-top: 10px;">연결 중...</p>
        <div class="call-btn-red" onclick="endCall()">📵</div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function openApp(id) { document.getElementById(id).style.display = 'flex'; }
    function closeApp(id) { document.getElementById(id).style.display = 'none'; }
    
    let audioCtx = null;
    function openCall(name) {
        document.getElementById('callName').innerText = name;
        document.getElementById('callStatus').innerText = '연결 중...';
        document.getElementById('callScreen').style.display = 'flex';
        
        // Simulating ring sound
        setTimeout(() => {
            if(name === '수호') {
                document.getElementById('callStatus').innerText = '응답 없음 (음성함으로 연결됩니다)';
            }
        }, 4000);
    }
    function endCall() { document.getElementById('callScreen').style.display = 'none'; }
</script>
</body>
</html>
